</span>)</span></span>\n      | <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Sum.inr\">Sum.inr</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span> =&gt; <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">inv</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Sum.inr\">Sum.inr</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span></span></span></span><a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">;</a>       <span class=\"fn\">einv</span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦄</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦃</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">inv</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Sum.inl\">Sum.inl</a> <span class=\"fn\">init</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦄</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/While.html#repeatM\">_root_.repeatM</a> <span class=\"fn\">f</span> <span class=\"fn\">init</span></span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦃</a> <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\">β</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">inv</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Sum.inr\">Sum.inr</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span></span></span><a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">;</a> <span class=\"fn\">einv</span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦄</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Specification for `repeatM`. The user supplies a termination `measure`, an invariant, and a step\n`Triple` whose pre asserts the measure evaluates to `ma` and the in-progress invariant holds, and\nwhose post either continues with a measure value below `ma` (the invariant still holding) or\nfinishes with the `.inr` invariant.\n","docLink":"./Std/WP/Triple/SpecLemmas.html#Std.WP.Spec.repeatM","kind":"theorem","line":2137,"name":"Std.WP.Spec.repeatM","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26